<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="teaser cmp-teaser--racing-editorial cmp-teaser--racing-content-first cmp-teaser--racing-light aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<article class="cmp-teaser">
  <div class="cmp-teaser__image">
    <img src="/content/dam/adlc-crowdstrike/racing/about-us/we-stop-breaches.png" alt="No. 04 CrowdStrike prototype racing at speed" loading="lazy"/>
  </div>
  <div class="cmp-teaser__content">
    
    <h2 class="cmp-teaser__title">We Stop Breaches</h2>
    <div class="cmp-teaser__description"><p>CrowdStrike has redefined modern security with the industryâ€™s most advanced agentic security platform, unifying protection across endpoints, cloud workloads, identity, and data. The CrowdStrike Falcon Platform brings AI-driven automation and real-time intelligence to the SOC, combining human expertise with machine-speed action to stop breaches and protect the people, organizations, and technologies shaping the future.</p></div>
  </div>
</article>
