<div class="teaser cmp-teaser--racing-editorial cmp-teaser--racing-media-first cmp-teaser--racing-dark aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<article class="cmp-teaser">
  <div class="cmp-teaser__image">
    <img src="/content/dam/adlc-crowdstrike/racing/about-us/why-we-race.png" alt="CrowdStrike Racing crew performing a nighttime pit stop on the No. 04 car" loading="lazy"/>
  </div>
  <div class="cmp-teaser__content">
    
    <h2 class="cmp-teaser__title">Why We Race</h2>
    <div class="cmp-teaser__description"><p>Performance under pressure defines both cybersecurity and world-class racing. Speed, agility, and resilience are critical when staying ahead of rapidly-evolving threats, on and off the track.</p><p>CrowdStrike, in partnership with AWS, convenes C-level cybersecurity leaders at premier race weekends around the world to explore how operational excellence and teamwork drive sustained performance in high-stakes environments.</p></div>
  </div>
</article>
